### Flask vs Django — Professional Framework Strategy

| Flask | Django |
|---|---|
| Lightweight and flexible | Structured and batteries-included |
| Explicit architecture choices | Built-in application conventions |
| SQLAlchemy commonly used | Django ORM |
| Extensions for admin/auth | Built-in admin/auth |
| Good for lightweight services and custom applications | Good for structured business applications |

Do not assume Django is automatically more secure or scalable. Both frameworks require good architecture, testing, deployment and security practices.

