### Important Formulas

Expectancy:

Expectancy = (Win Rate × Average Win) − (Loss Rate × Average Loss)

Use average loss as a positive absolute value.

Profit Factor:

Profit Factor = Gross Profit ÷ Absolute Gross Loss

Maximum Drawdown:

Maximum Drawdown = Largest Peak-to-Trough Decline in Equity

Use consistent net-of-fees returns and correct position sizing.

